        "question": "How Mikale knows that Salander is a hacker?",
        "answer": "While reading Salander’s report, Blomkvist recognized wording from a press release that existed only on his private iBook. He concluded that she had been inside his computer and said, “You’re a fucking hacker.” [E1] [E2]",
